#, fuzzy
msgid "Tree-shaking JAR dependencies"
msgstr "树状 JAR 依赖关系"

#, fuzzy
msgid "This feature is experimental and subject to change. Please provide feedback if you encounter issues."
msgstr "此功能尚处于试验阶段，可能会有变动。如果您遇到问题，请提供反馈。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Tree-shaking analyzes your application's bytecode at build time to determine which classes from runtime dependencies are actually reachable.\n"
"Unreachable classes are excluded from the produced JAR, reducing its size."
msgstr "树摇动（Tree-shaking）会在构建时分析应用程序的字节码，以确定运行时依赖项中的哪些类实际上是可触及的。不可触及的类将被排除在生成的 JAR 文件之外，从而减小其大小。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "This applies to `fast-jar`, `uber-jar`, `legacy-jar`, and `aot-jar` package types."
msgstr "这适用于 `fast-jar` 、 `uber-jar` 、 `legacy-jar` 和 `aot-jar` 这几种包类型。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Enabling tree-shaking"
msgstr "启用树形抖动"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Tree-shaking is disabled by default.\n"
"To enable it, add the following property to your `application.properties`:"
msgstr "树摇动功能默认处于禁用状态。要启用该功能，请在 `application.properties` 文件中添加以下属性："

#, fuzzy
msgid "To explicitly disable it (if it was enabled elsewhere, e.g., in a parent profile):"
msgstr "若要明确禁用该功能（如果该功能在其他地方已被启用，例如在父配置文件中）："

#, fuzzy
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When tree-shaking is enabled, Quarkus determines which dependency classes are actually reachable and excludes the rest from the final JAR.\n"
"The algorithm runs in several stages:"
msgstr "启用树摇动功能后，Quarkus 会确定哪些依赖类实际上是可访问的，并将其余类从最终的 JAR 文件中排除。该算法分几个阶段运行："

#, fuzzy
msgid "Root collection"
msgstr "根系采集"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The analysis starts by collecting root classes — classes that must be preserved regardless of bytecode references.\n"
"Roots include the application main class, all generated classes, classes registered for reflection or JNI access (by extensions or in `reflect-config.json` and `jni-config.json` files under `META-INF/native-image`), and service provider implementations."
msgstr "分析首先从收集根类开始——这些类无论字节码引用如何，都必须保留。 根类包括应用程序的主类、所有生成的类、已注册用于反射或 JNI 访问的类（通过扩展，或位于 `META-INF/native-image` 目录下的 `reflect-config.json` 和 `jni-config.json` 文件中），以及服务提供者的实现类。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Building a native executable adds more roots, see <<native-builds>>."
msgstr "构建本机可执行文件会增加更多根目录，详见 <<native-builds>> 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "BFS reachability"
msgstr "BFS 可达性"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Starting from roots, a breadth-first search walks bytecode references to discover all reachable dependency classes.\n"
"The BFS recognizes the following patterns:"
msgstr "从根节点开始，广度优先搜索会遍历字节码引用，以发现所有可达的依赖类。BFS 识别以下模式："

#, fuzzy
msgid "Direct class references"
msgstr "直接类引用"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Superclasses, implemented interfaces, field types, method parameter and return types, and exception types in `throws` clauses."
msgstr "超类、已实现的接口、字段类型、方法的参数类型和返回类型，以及 `throws` 子句中的异常类型。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Annotations and generics"
msgstr "注解与泛型"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Class references appearing in annotation values and generic type signatures."
msgstr "出现在注解值和泛型类型签名中的类引用。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "ServiceLoader / SPI"
msgstr "ServiceLoader / SPI"

#, fuzzy
msgid "`ServiceLoader.load()` calls where the service interface is a compile-time constant, and implementations listed in `META-INF/services` files."
msgstr "在 `ServiceLoader.load()` 的调用中，服务接口是一个编译时常量，其实现类则列在 `META-INF/services` 文件中。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Dynamic class loading"
msgstr "动态类加载"

#, fuzzy
msgid "`Class.forName()`, `ClassLoader.loadClass()`, and `MethodHandles.Lookup.findClass()` calls where the class name is a string constant in the bytecode. For cases where class names are constructed at runtime (e.g., via `StringBuilder` or `invokedynamic` string concatenation), the tree-shaker traces the call chain up to the class whose constructor or static initializer triggers the loading, then executes it in a forked JVM with an isolated class loader to dynamically capture which classes are loaded. This handles libraries like BouncyCastle that build class names from package prefixes and algorithm name arrays."
msgstr "`Class.forName()` 、 `ClassLoader.loadClass()` 和 `MethodHandles.Lookup.findClass()` 的调用，其中类名是字节码中的字符串常量。对于类名在运行时构建的情况（例如，通过 `StringBuilder` 或 `invokedynamic` 字符串拼接）， 树震动器会沿调用链向上追溯至触发加载的构造函数或静态初始化器的类，然后在具有隔离类加载器的分叉 JVM 中执行该类，从而动态捕获被加载的类。这可以处理像 BouncyCastle 这样的库，它们会根据包前缀和算法名称数组来构建类名。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Reflection, JNI, and service provider registrations"
msgstr "反射、JNI 和服务提供商注册"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Classes registered by extensions for reflection (`ReflectiveClassBuildItem`, `ReflectiveFieldBuildItem`, `ReflectiveMethodBuildItem`), JNI runtime access (`JniRuntimeAccessBuildItem`, `JniRuntimeAccessFieldBuildItem`, `JniRuntimeAccessMethodBuildItem`), and service providers (`ServiceProviderBuildItem`) are treated as root classes, see <<root-collection>>. Weak reflective registrations are excluded — they are only preserved if bytecode analysis independently reaches them. Conditional registrations (`ReflectiveClassConditionBuildItem`) are evaluated to a fixed point: a conditionally registered class becomes a root only when its condition type is reachable."
msgstr "扩展为反射注册的类（ `ReflectiveClassBuildItem` 、 `ReflectiveFieldBuildItem` 、 `ReflectiveMethodBuildItem` ）， JNI 运行时访问（ `JniRuntimeAccessBuildItem` 、 `JniRuntimeAccessFieldBuildItem` 、 `JniRuntimeAccessMethodBuildItem` ）以及服务提供者（ `ServiceProviderBuildItem` ）所注册的类均被视为根类，详见 <<root-collection>> 。 弱反射注册会被排除——只有当字节码分析独立地到达它们时，才会保留这些注册。条件注册（ `ReflectiveClassConditionBuildItem` ）会被评估到一个固定点：只有当其条件类型可达时，条件注册的类才会成为根类。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "String constants"
msgstr "字符串常量"

#, fuzzy
msgid "When a method contains a string constant that exactly matches a fully-qualified dependency class name, that class is marked reachable. Comma- or colon-delimited lists of class names (as used by some frameworks) are also handled by splitting and matching each part."
msgstr "当一个方法包含一个与完全限定依赖类名完全匹配的字符串常量时，该类会被标记为可达。以逗号或冒号分隔的类名列表（某些框架中使用）也会通过拆分并逐一匹配各部分的方式进行处理。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Inner and outer classes"
msgstr "内部类和外部类"

#, fuzzy
msgid "If an outer class is reachable, its inner classes are preserved."
msgstr "如果一个外层类是可访问的，则其内部类将被保留。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Multi-release JAR entries"
msgstr "多版本 JAR 条目"

#, fuzzy
msgid "`META-INF/versions/N/` entries are analyzed, picking the highest version compatible with the application's target Java version. Entries targeting newer Java versions are also preserved when they are referenced by reachable higher-version code, ensuring the JAR works correctly when run on a newer JVM (e.g., native image built with Mandrel 25 while the app was compiled with JDK 21)."
msgstr "系统会分析 `META-INF/versions/N` 条目，并选择与应用程序目标 Java 版本兼容的最高版本。 当可访问的高版本代码引用了针对更新版 Java 版本的条目时，这些条目也会被保留，从而确保 JAR 文件在较新的 JVM 上运行时能够正常工作（例如，应用程序使用 JDK 21 编译，而本机映像则是使用 Mandrel 25 构建的）。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "JBoss Logging companions"
msgstr "JBoss 日志记录相关工具"

#, fuzzy
msgid "`_$logger` and `_$bundle` companion classes are automatically included when their owning class is reachable."
msgstr "当其所属类可访问时 `_，$logger_` _和_ `$bundle` 的伴生类会自动被包含进来。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Sisu named components"
msgstr "Sisu 命名的组件"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Classes discovered through Eclipse Sisu's named component loading are preserved."
msgstr "通过 Eclipse Sisu 的命名组件加载功能发现的类将被保留。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Class-loading chain analysis"
msgstr "类加载链分析"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Some libraries construct class names at runtime — for example, by concatenating a package prefix with an algorithm name via `StringBuilder` or `invokedynamic` — and load them via `ClassLoader.loadClass()` during static initialization.\n"
"Because the class name strings are computed dynamically, the BFS over bytecode references cannot trace them."
msgstr "有些库会在运行时构造类名——例如，通过 `StringBuilder` 或 `invokedynamic` 将包前缀与算法名称拼接起来——并在静态初始化期间通过 `ClassLoader.loadClass()` 加载这些类。由于类名字符串是动态计算的，因此基于字节码引用的 BFS 无法追踪它们。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "To handle this, the tree-shaker runs a class-loading chain analysis after the BFS:"
msgstr "为了解决这个问题，Tree Shaker 会在 BFS 之后执行类加载链分析："

#, fuzzy
msgid "**Seed propagation**: Builds a reverse caller index (callee to callers) during the BFS bytecode scan and identifies methods that transitively call `ClassLoader.loadClass(String)`, `Class.forName(String)`, or `MethodHandles.Lookup.findClass(String)` using an efficient worklist algorithm. The caller index is extended incrementally across iterations."
msgstr "*种子传播* ：在BFS字节码扫描过程中构建一个反向调用者索引（从被调用者到调用者），并利用高效的待处理列表算法，识别出那些通过传递方式 `调用ClassLoader.loadClass(String)` 、 `Class.forName(String)` `或MethodHandles.Lookup.findClass(String)` 的方法。 调用者索引会在每次迭代中逐步扩展。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "**Entry point discovery**: Walks up the caller chain to find classes whose constructor (`<init>`) or static initializer (`<clinit>`) triggers the class-loading chain."
msgstr "*入口点发现* ：沿调用者链向上遍历，以查找其构造函数（ `<init>` ）或静态初始化器（ `<clinit>` ）会触发类加载链的类。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "**Dynamic execution**: Each entry point class is executed in a forked JVM process with an isolated `RecordingClassLoader` that captures every class load attempt — including failed attempts. After instantiation, if the object is a `Map` (e.g., a JCA security provider), its values are also inspected for class name strings that are stored for deferred loading. Running in a separate process ensures complete isolation of global JVM state and is safe for parallel Maven builds (`-T2C`)."
msgstr "*动态执行* ：每个入口点类都在一个分叉的 JVM 进程中执行，该进程拥有一个隔离的 `RecordingClassLoader` ，用于捕获每次类加载尝试——包括失败的尝试。 实例化后，如果对象是一个 `Map` （例如 JCA 安全提供程序），其值也会被检查是否包含类名字符串，这些字符串会被存储起来以供延迟加载。在单独的进程中运行可确保全局 JVM 状态的完全隔离，并且对并行 Maven 构建（ `-T2C` ）是安全的。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The chain analysis runs in an incremental fixed-point loop: the reverse caller index is extended as new classes are discovered. Only new entry points are executed in each iteration, avoiding redundant work. The loop terminates when no new classes are found."
msgstr "链分析在增量定点循环中运行：随着新类的发现，反向调用者索引会相应扩展。每次迭代中仅执行新的入口点，从而避免了冗余工作。当不再发现新类时，循环即终止。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For example, BouncyCastle's `BouncyCastleProvider` constructor calls `setup()` which calls `loadAlgorithms()` which calls `loadServiceClass()` which calls `ClassUtil.loadClass()`.\n"
"The tree-shaker identifies `BouncyCastleProvider` as the entry point, instantiates it in the recording class loader, and captures all dynamically loaded algorithm classes."
msgstr "例如，BouncyCastle 的 `BouncyCastleProvider` 构造函数会调用 `setup()` ，该方法会调用 `loadAlgorithms()` ，后者又会调用 `loadServiceClass()` ，最后由 `loadServiceClass()` 调用 `ClassUtil.loadClass()` 。 Tree-shaker 将 `BouncyCastleProvider` 识别为入口点，在记录类加载器中对其进行实例化，并捕获所有动态加载的算法类。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Module-level tree-shaking"
msgstr "模块级树摇动"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When a Quarkus modular packaging extension is present (for example, `quarkus-jlink`), tree-shaking also operates at the module level.\n"
"After the class-level analysis determines which classes are reachable, the module tree-shaker evaluates each module in the application's module model:"
msgstr "当存在 Quarkus 模块化打包扩展（例如 `quarkus-jlink` ）时，树摇操作也会在模块级别进行。在类级分析确定哪些类是可达的之后，模块树摇器会评估应用程序模块模型中的每个模块："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "A module is *class-dead* if it contains `.class` entries but none of them are in the reachable set. Class-dead modules are removed entirely from the packaged application."
msgstr "如果一个模块包含 `.class` 条目，但其中没有任何一个属于可达集，则该模块被视为 *“类已失效”* 。类已失效的模块将从打包后的应用程序中完全移除。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "A module with no `.class` entries at all (a resource-only JAR) is kept alive — it may provide configuration files, native libraries, or other resources needed at runtime."
msgstr "完全不包含任何 `.class` 条目的模块（仅包含资源的 JAR 文件）会保持激活状态——它可能提供配置文件、本机库或其他运行时所需的资源。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "A module with an empty content tree (no content to contribute) is treated as dead."
msgstr "内容树为空（无内容可发布）的模块将被视为已失效。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "After dead modules are removed, surviving modules are cleaned up:"
msgstr "移除失效模块后，对剩余模块进行清理："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "`requires` directives pointing to removed modules are dropped."
msgstr "`需要` 删除指向已移除模块的指令。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Auto-dependency groups whose entries all point to removed modules are dropped."
msgstr "所有条目均指向已删除模块的自动依赖组将被删除。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Service provider entries (`provides ... with ...`) whose implementation classes are not in the reachable set are removed."
msgstr "那些其实现类不在可达集中的服务提供者条目（ `为……提供……` ）将被移除。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Unreachable classes are removed from the module, while non-class resources (for example, resource bundles) are always kept.\n"
"Packages left with no content are removed from the module descriptor, together with any `add-exports` or `add-opens` of those packages declared by other modules."
msgstr "无法访问的类将从模块中移除，而非类资源（例如资源包）则始终保留。内容为空的包将从模块描述符中移除，同时其他模块针对这些包声明的任何 `add-exports` 或 `add-opens` 也会一并移除。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The set of JDK modules required by the application is recomputed from surviving modules only, which can reduce the size of a `jlink` image."
msgstr "应用程序所需的 JDK 模块集仅根据存活的模块重新计算，这可以减小 `jlink` 映像的大小。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The module tree-shaker also performs a graph reachability analysis — a BFS from root modules (the application module and boot modules) through the dependency graph.\n"
"Modules that are not reachable from any root but still contain reachable classes are *not* removed, since they may be accessed via reflection, service loading, or from automatic modules without explicit `requires` directives.\n"
"A warning is logged for such modules to help diagnose missing dependency declarations."
msgstr "tree-shaker 模块还会执行图可达性分析——即从根模块（应用程序模块和启动模块）开始，沿依赖关系图进行广度优先搜索（BFS）。 那些无法从任何根模块访问、但仍包含可访问类的模块 *不会被* 移除，因为可以通过反射、服务加载，或从没有显式 ``requires` ` 指令的自动模块中访问它们。系统会针对此类模块记录一条警告，以帮助诊断缺失的依赖声明。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Native builds"
msgstr "本机构建"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When tree-shaking is enabled for a native build, it applies to the JARs passed to `native-image`, including those produced with `quarkus.native.sources-only=true`.\n"
