#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "GraalVM substitutions, as described below."
msgstr "GraalVM 的替换，如下所述。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "These roots are not considered for JVM builds, so a JVM build may remove classes that a native build of the same application keeps."
