#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "GraalVM substitutions"
msgstr "GraalVM 的替代方案"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`native-image` discovers substitution classes (`@TargetClass`), in dependencies or in the application, by scanning the class path, and fails if a substitution's target class is missing.\n"
"So a substitution class is kept when its target class is kept, and its target class is kept when the substitution class is kept:"
msgstr "`native-image` 通过扫描类路径，在依赖项或应用程序中发现替换类（ `@TargetClass` ），如果替换的目标类不存在，则会失败。因此，当目标类被保留时，替换类也会被保留；而当替换类被保留时，其目标类也会被保留："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "A substitution whose target is always present (a JDK or GraalVM class, an application class, or a class of an artifact excluded from tree-shaking) is always kept."
msgstr "如果替换的目标始终存在（无论是 JDK 或 GraalVM 类、应用程序类，还是被排除在树摇动之外的工件中的类），则该替换将始终被保留。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "A substitution whose target is not on the class path at all is removed."
msgstr "如果替换的目标完全不在类路径上，则该替换将被移除。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Substitutions whose target is computed by a `classNameProvider`, and other classes using GraalVM substitution annotations, are always kept."
msgstr "由 `类名提供器` （ `classNameProvider` ）计算目标的替换，以及使用 GraalVM 替换注解的其他类，都会被保留。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For a target given as an `innerClass`, `native-image` looks it up among the declared classes of the enclosing classes.\n"
"So when such a substitution is kept, the enclosing classes and all their member classes are kept loadable: together with their superclasses and interfaces, but without the classes only their code references."
msgstr "对于作为 `内部类` （ `innerClass）` 给出的目标 `，native-image` 会在其外围类的已声明类中进行查找。因此，当保留此类替换时，外围类及其所有成员类均保持可加载状态：包括其超类和接口，但不包括仅包含代码引用的类。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Excluding artifacts from tree-shaking"
msgstr "将伪对象排除在树摇动之外"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Some libraries may not work correctly if classes are removed — for example, libraries that perform self-integrity checks (e.g., BouncyCastle FIPS) or that load classes through mechanisms the tree-shaker cannot detect."
